🧠 Introduction

Hugging Face makes AI development easy using:

* Pipeline Abstraction
* Inference API

👉 These help you **use powerful models with minimal code**.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 1. What is Pipeline Abstraction?

A **pipeline** is a high-level API that simplifies using AI models.

👉 Instead of writing complex code:

```text id="p1x7qz"
Use one line → Get result
```

---

🎯 Why Pipelines?

✔ Easy to use
✔ No deep model knowledge required
✔ Quick prototyping
✔ Less code

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚙️ Installation

```bash id="u4n8zp"
pip install transformers
```

---

📥 Import Pipeline

```python id="z2m5kp"
from transformers import pipeline
```

---

🔹 Common Pipelines

| Task               | Pipeline Name        |
| ------------------ | -------------------- |
| Sentiment Analysis | "sentiment-analysis" |
| Text Generation    | "text-generation"    |
| Summarization      | "summarization"      |
| Translation        | "translation"        |
| Question Answering | "question-answering" |

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

💻 Example 1: Sentiment Analysis

```python id="k9w3xz"
classifier = pipeline("sentiment-analysis")

print(classifier("I love AI"))
```

---

💻 Example 2: Text Generation

```python id="q2p8mn"
generator = pipeline("text-generation")

print(generator("AI is the future", max_length=30))
```

---

💻 Example 3: Summarization

```python id="r7t5pl"
summarizer = pipeline("summarization")

text = "Artificial Intelligence is transforming industries..."

print(summarizer(text))
```

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 How Pipeline Works Internally

```text id="b5v2yx"
Input → Tokenizer → Model → Output → Post-processing
```

---

⚠️ Limitations of Pipeline

❌ Limited customization
❌ Not suitable for complex use cases
❌ Less control over model

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔗 2. Inference API

The **Inference API** allows you to use models **via cloud without downloading them**.

---

🔹 What is Inference API?

```text id="x9k3qa"
Send request → Model runs on server → Get response
```

---

🌐 Why Use Inference API?

✔ No heavy setup
✔ Works on low-end systems
✔ Easy integration in apps
✔ Scalable

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔐 API Key Setup

1. Create Hugging Face account
2. Generate API token
3. Use in requests

---

💻 Example: Using Inference API

```python id="v8m4pn"
import requests

API_URL = "https://api-inference.huggingface.co/models/gpt2"
headers = {"Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_API_KEY"}

data = {"inputs": "AI is changing the world"}

response = requests.post(API_URL, headers=headers, json=data)

print(response.json())
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚡ Pipeline vs Inference API

| Feature     | Pipeline     | Inference API  |
| ----------- | ------------ | -------------- |
| Setup       | Local        | Cloud          |
| Speed       | Fast (local) | Depends on API |
| Ease        | Very easy    | Easy           |
| Scalability | Limited      | High           |

---

🔄 Workflow

```text id="t1z7qp"
Pipeline (Local Testing) → Inference API (Deployment)
```

